1. Objective

The objective of this task is to convert cleaned TED Talks text into numerical features using TF-IDF and identify similar talks using cosine similarity.

2. Implementation

I loaded the cleaned TED Talks dataset from "data/processed/ted_talks_cleaned.csv" and checked the available columns and usable records.

