4. Concepts Learned

TF-IDF: It converts text into numerical values and gives importance to useful words.

Cosine Similarity: It compares numerical vectors to measure the similarity between TED Talks.

Ranking: It sorts talks according to similarity scores to identify the most similar recommendations.

5. Limitations

TF-IDF mainly considers word patterns and does not fully understand the meaning of text. Talks with similar words may have different meanings, and related talks using different vocabulary may receive lower scores. A high similarity score does not guarantee user satisfaction.

